    "text": "Simone Biles (born 1997) is the most decorated gymnast in history, with 41 combined World and Olympic medals, and has five gymnastic skills named after her. Her comeback to win gold at the Paris 2024 Olympics made her a symbol of both excellence and mental health courage."
