    "text": "Muhammad Ali (1942\u20132016) was a three-time heavyweight boxing champion who won Olympic gold in 1960, then gave up his title and prime years rather than fight in the Vietnam War, on principle. He later lit the Olympic flame in 1996 and became a global humanitarian."
