  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Who played the trumpet on Kind of Blue, jazz's best-selling album?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Miles Davis (1926\u20131991) was a jazz trumpeter and bandleader from Illinois who reinvented jazz at least five times \u2014 bebop, cool jazz, modal jazz on Kind of Blue (the best-selling jazz album ever), and electric fusion on Bitches Brew."
