   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Sarah Vaughan (1924\u20131990), nicknamed 'Sassy' and 'The Divine One,' was a jazz singer with a classically trained, opera-sized voice and perfect control. Discovered at Harlem's Apollo Theater, she sang with bebop pioneers and symphony orchestras alike."
   }
  },
