    "text": "Dizzy Gillespie (1917\u20131993) was a bebop trumpeter recognizable by his bent trumpet, bulging cheeks, and goatee, who co-created bebop with Charlie Parker and introduced Afro-Cuban rhythms to jazz with conga master Chano Pozo."
