   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Where does Nelson Mandela stand in London?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "The bronze statue of Nelson Mandela in London's Parliament Square, unveiled in 2007 while Mandela still lived \u2014 he joked he had become 'a tourist attraction' \u2014 places the South African freedom leader among Britain's statesmen, facing the Parliament he once petitioned from prison."
   }
